# Arathi Highlands (32-33): the first visit to Hammerfall (Drum Fel, Tor'gan and Gor'mul, Doctor
# Gregory Victor), the errands Tarren Mill sends there and the Dabyrie brothers for Undercity, for a
# Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/arathi_highlands_32_33.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Arathi Highlands, area 45).
# The quest list is section 13 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md. The rest of Hammerfall's
# quests (Call to Arms 678, Guile of the Raptor 701, The Princess Trapped 642...) are in Alterac
# Mountains & Arathi Highlands (38-39).
# Left to later guides: Final Passage (1394, from Parqual Fintallas in Undercity, after his Test of
#   Lore), handed in by Thousand Needles (33-34).
# Left out: This Must Be The Place (79976): it follows Eagle's Fist (79975), found at the
#   Stonewrought Dam in Loch Modan after Wet Job (79974) in Stonetalon, and no guide takes those.
#   Defiler's Basic Care Package (8263): it needs Friendly with the Defilers, earned in Arathi Basin.
#   The Battle for Arathi Basin! (8170): its objectives are inside the Arathi Basin battleground.
#   Crystal in the Mountains (635): it starts from the Pendant of Myzrael, a very rare world drop.
#
# The route: Tarren Mill (the Mudsnout Blossoms of Nethander Stead); a flight to Undercity and back
# for the hand-ins and the Dabyrie quest; the road east through Thoradin's Wall, the Boulderfist
# Outpost and the Dabyrie Farmstead on the way to Hammerfall; a loop south to the Witherbark trolls;
# a loop west to Northfold Manor; the hearthstone back to Hammerfall and a flight to Undercity, where
# the zeppelin to Orgrimmar leaves for the next guide.

guide Arathi Highlands (32-33)
faction horde
levels 32 33
leave 1394
next Thousand Needles (33-34)

# Tarren Mill -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Hillsbrad Foothills
note "From the rest of Hillsbrad, ride to Tarren Mill (or fly there)" at 61.0,19.5
accept 509
accept 550
tip High Executor Darthalia gives this commendation once you have finished the Battle of Hillsbrad. Not offered? Skip this step.
accept 676
do 509
tip Nethander Stead is south of Tarren Mill, east of the river from Southshore: the Mudsnout Blossoms grow in its fields.
turnin 509
accept 513

# Undercity -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 2389
map Undercity
accept 1164
tip Genavie Callow stands a few steps from the flight master.
turnin 513
tip Master Apothecary Faranell is in the Apothecarium.
turnin 550
tip Varimathras stands beside the Dark Lady in the Royal Quarter.
accept 1394
tip Parqual Fintallas gives this one once you passed his Test of Lore: keep it, the next guide hands it in at Thousand Needles. Not offered? Skip this step.
fly "Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad" npc 4551
tip Already have the Hammerfall flight path? Fly there instead and do the Boulderfist Outpost and the Dabyrie Farmstead from Hammerfall.

# Thoradin's Wall, the Boulderfist Outpost and the Dabyrie Farmstead -----------------------------------

map Arathi Highlands
goto "Ride east from Tarren Mill and through the gate of Thoradin's Wall into the Arathi Highlands" at 21.0,30.5 r 40
do 676.1
tip The Boulderfist Outpost lies north-east of Stromgarde: the Boulderfist Ogres stand around the mound.
do 676.2
tip The Enforcers are inside the cave of the outpost.
do 1164
tip The Dabyrie Farmstead is on the way east to Hammerfall. Kenata and Marcel are inside the buildings; Fardel walks around the farm.

# Hammerfall -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fpath 2851
bind 9501
turnin 676
accept 677
accept 655
turnin 655
accept 672 671
accept 97539
tip Doctor Gregory Victor is inside the longhouse.

# South: the Witherbark trolls ------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 672 bg
tip The Highland raptors roam all over the highlands: kill every one you pass for their eyes.
do 97539 bg
tip Plains Creepers and Giant Plains Creepers are spread over the plains too.
do 677.1
tip The Witherbark trolls camp in the hills south of Hammerfall: Axe Throwers and Witch Doctors in the northern camps, Headhunters around Witherbark Village further south.
do 677.3
do 677.2
accept 92707 at 68.5,79.6 icon kill "Kill the Witherbark Goliath for its Goliath's Wristguards, then use them: they start a quest"
tip The Goliath, a level 35 elite, stands in the south of Witherbark Village: fight it together.
do 92707
goto "Return to Hammerfall" at 73.8,34.0 r 20
turnin 677
turnin 92707

# West: Northfold Manor --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 671
tip The Syndicate hold Northfold Manor, in the north-west near Thoradin's Wall. Pathstalkers hide in stealth around the ruins.
do 672 at 38.2,35.5
tip Highland Thrashers prowl the hills between the manor and the middle of the highlands.
do 97539 at 42.5,31.9
tip The Giant Plains Creepers spin their webs east of Northfold Manor.
grind 33 at 38.0,34.0
tip Not quite 33 yet? The Highland Thrashers and the Giant Plains Creepers here finish the level.
hearth npc 9501

# Hammerfall ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 671
turnin 672
accept 674
turnin 674
accept 675
turnin 675
turnin 97539

# Undercity and the zeppelin ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 2851
map Undercity
turnin 1164
train 4593 260093 4582 4606 4566 4563
tip Hunters, shamans and druids have no trainer here: train in Orgrimmar, where the next guide starts.
map Tirisfal Glades
note "Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Undercity to Durotar, for the next guide" npc 9566
tip The tower stands just outside the ruins of Lordaeron, a short walk north of the way out of Undercity. Zapetta sends the zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
